## Reviewer got wrong (not applied)

- A7. Q16–Q20 are body paragraphs in the Korean source and in the English file. Promoting them to headings fails the heading-level check.
- A8 / B8 and the U+200B verdict lines. The zero-width lines match the Korean source. Deleting them fails `blocks`. They are source layout. The Portuguese sentences around them were completed inside the existing blocks instead.
- A10. "por cada 1 vítima", "por cada 1 acidente", and "por cada 1 ano" keep a source digit. "ultrapassar 1 pessoa" in 005 is the counted threshold “more than 1 worker”, not the redundant “each”.
- A12, the request to drop article 10 from the public label. The Korean anchor still names article 10 of the business-tax act, and that digit has to remain. The URL stays `flno=3`. The editor’s phrase “a disposição ligada” was removed; “não o artigo 10” stays.
- "Se se constituir uma subsidiária" (018). "Constituir" there means to form a company. The waiver and the residual-property claim were the "constituir-se" errors.
- "ficha de vencimento" (014) and the loan’s "vencimento" (002). The wages misreading was "natureza dos vencimentos" in the bankruptcy checklist, and "vencimentos de pagamento" for child-support due dates. Those two were changed.
